{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "label": "73 \u2014 the cause of the drift, and what a windowed pool actually buys", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Extends log/72, which bounded itself twice; one of the two results goes against the earlier framing and is reported at the same length."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_level_coupling", "label": "_level_coupling \u2014 deflation by a trailing 28-day mean of takings", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A comparison rather than an assertion: if the raw residual drifts and the deflated one does not, the drift is a scale effect riding on the level. The trailing mean is taken strictly before the target date so nothing uses information the band would not have had."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_explanatory_asymmetry", "label": "The explanation covers exactly the cases that need explaining", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The two venues whose coverage departs from nominal are the two whose drift is a level effect; the venue whose drift is not a level effect is the venue whose coverage is fine. That is a stronger position than one covering all three."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_mondrian_partition_misspecification", "label": "A misspecified Mondrian partition", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "17.2% of the days the Beer Hall's calendar calls closed actually traded, with mean |residual| 238.0 against 32.21 on genuinely closed days \u2014 misses by construction. A distinct violation from the drift, and no amount of recency weighting repairs it."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_windowed_calibration_pool", "label": "The windowed calibration pool, tested", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It fixes the venue whose drift mechanism is strongest, does little for the venue whose shortfall is mostly a different mechanism, and harms the venue that had no problem. That the remedy tracks the mechanism venue by venue is itself confirmation of the diagnosis."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_further_work_partition_by_trading", "label": "Further Work \u2014 partition Mondrian groups by observed trading", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The second mechanism has the cheaper remedy: deriving the group from observed trading rather than the weekday would move those 94 observations into the group they belong to. A change to a served artefact, so Further Work, not a result."}, {"id": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_ellel_drift_unexplained", "label": "Ellel's drift is unexplained", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The diagnostic rules out the level of trade there and offers no substitute."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_du6_exchangeability", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "target": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_level_coupling", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "target": "brain_log_72_du6_exchangeability_result_exchangeability_diagnostic", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_level_coupling", "target": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_explanatory_asymmetry", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "target": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_mondrian_partition_misspecification", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_du6_cause_and_remedy", "target": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_windowed_calibration_pool", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "brain/log/73_DU6_cause_and_remedy_result.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "brain_log_73_du6_cause_and_remedy_result_windowed_cal